  "_beats": [
    "0.0-0.4s  RAW: ungraded full frame + viewfinder + plain subtitle = the 'before' look",
    "0.34s     WIPE (signature move, used once): lime band reveals graded, reframed footage + big hook captions",
    "w:12-14   badge 'DIEDIT PAKE AI' above the head, punch-in + impact + burst on 'AI'",
    "w:15      hard cut + flash back to RAW on 'Ini video mentahannya' (callback to the opening)",
    "w:18      split: raw card left / edited card right on 'dan ini setelah'; prompt bar types on 'suruh AI untuk ngedit'",
    "w:26-35   full frame; REAL waveform of the clip shows the removed pause being cut on 'jeda'; one feature tile per spoken feature; real punch-in on 'zoom'",
    "w:36-41   tiles fly into a prompt bar = 'semuanya gue arahin lewat chat doang'",
    "w:42-56   chat split: user types the revision on 'ketik revisinya', AI re-renders on 'AI yang bantu kerjain lagi', card tag v1 -> v2",
    "w:57-80   back to full frame; 'MAU WORKFLOW-NYA?' badge; Tutorial / AI Skill cards when those words are spoken",
    "w:81-end  end card: face in a circle, kicker, brand wordmark (the user's brand, written by the user) on the spoken brand, CTA button on 'tombol di bawah ini', music hit on 'Let's go!'"
  ]
